1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,810
Apna WordCamp organize kar rahe ho?

2
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:05,720
Attendee app khud banane ki zaroorat nahi, CampBuddy ready hai.

3
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:09,190
Roster, schedule aur sponsors apne aap fetch ho jaate hain.

4
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:13,670
Apne local organizers ko event managers bana do — sirf unke event tak access.

5
00:00:13,670 --> 00:00:16,650
Har change ek activity log mein record hota hai.

6
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:20,110
campbuddy.club pe jaake free mein set up karo, aaj hi.
